      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-18",
      "text": "天杨以\"什么不敢？敢做不敢应么？\"\"放下！\"步步追问，法明答\"敢应不敢放\"\"我两手皆空，放什么\"，天杨再问\"那为什么还抓着\"，法明答\"心有灵犀\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0055/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0055"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我两手皆空，放什么"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-19",
      "text": "天杨连问\"如何是禅\"\"如何是正法眼\"\"如何悟证虚空\"，法明分别答\"是\"\"不是\"\"心无杂念\"后语塞脸红；天杨大笑\"原来你就这两下子\"，并称\"金山寺空有虚名，我云游四海，不见真人\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0055/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0055"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "金山寺空有虚名"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-20",
      "text": "论答到关键时刻，两位老和尚头上都起了白烟，四周僧众一面哗然。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "两个老和尚头上都起了白烟"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-21",
      "text": "人群中忽然也有人笑，笑的人是玄奘，所有人都回头看他。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "笑的人正是玄奘"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-22",
      "text": "天杨质问玄奘自己有何可笑之处，玄奘答因\"刚刚看门外树上两兔子厮打\"而笑；天杨驳\"兔子怎会在树上\"，玄奘反问\"那在树上的是什么呢？\"，天杨语塞，改口称\"小小年纪，便有如此功力\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "兔子怎会在树上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-23",
      "text": "一旁有僧人说玄奘\"是我们这儿最懒的一个，从不好好听讲诵经\"，法明喝止他，并让玄奘有话尽管说。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "最懒的一个"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-24",
      "text": "玄奘说\"我刚才真的看见兔子了，我还看见一只会脸红的白色百灵\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我还看见一只会脸红的白色百灵"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-25",
      "text": "窗边的小白龙听到这句\"吓得差点从窗上栽下去\"。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0017"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "差点从窗上栽下去"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-26",
      "text": "天杨问\"什么是佛\"，玄奘看看头上、脚下、门外，天杨据此判定他已回答\"无处不是佛\"，并说\"小师父，真有你的\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0055/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0055"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "无处不是佛"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-27",
      "text": "天杨再问\"如何悟证虚空\"，玄奘脱口答\"打破顽冥\"；天杨问\"是么？\"，玄奘答\"不是！\"，天杨斥\"不是还答！找打！\"，玄奘回\"不是还问！欠揍！\"，两人大眼瞪小眼，众僧惊呆。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "打破顽冥"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-28",
      "text": "良久后，天杨长叹\"你说得极是。我败了\"，向玄奘认输。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0055/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0055"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我败了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-29",
      "text": "叙述称\"玄奘一战成名\"；天杨走后，玄奘被全寺众僧围住，要他讲解最后一招如何接住、那句\"欠揍\"有何深意。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "玄奘一战成名"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-30",
      "text": "玄奘解释：\"他说我答错了要打我，我说我答错了又怎样你敢打我我便打你，他一看我年轻想想打不过我所以就认输了。\"听完，寺院里倒了一片。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0053/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0053"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "他一看我年轻想想打不过我所以就认输了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "claim-local-31",
      "text": "法明对玄奘说\"你聪慧过人，今后就在我身边修行，我将毕生所学传授予你\"。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0054/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0054"
      },
      "revealed_at": 15,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000015.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000015",
          "chapter_order": 15,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "我将毕生所学传授予你"
